  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIP:Youth Empowerment for Resilient Communities in Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through targeted interventions, the project aims to support the meaningful participation of young people in local development processes andthe implementation of social initiatives by youth-led volunteer organizations to contribute to social cohesion and resilience at the local level.The trained young women and men are expected to become more resilient, have a positive impact on society, and engage in dialoguebetween with the local authorities on issues affecting young peoples lives. Additionall</narrative>
  </description>
